    "description": "What: AQ97 A/C (CE-2322) - two soldiers stand idle in the open with no orders; a hostile rifleman 120 m away opens fire (all immortal). 'Reflex' carries nothing in the file, so he gets his type's default SOP (BasicInfantrySop); 'Inert' is stamped InertSop - the explicit 'no response'. Judge: (1) Reflex reacts by himself once he sees the hostile or is fired on - his task becomes TakeCover (a reaction) and he moves off his spot; (2) Inert never gets a task and never moves, whatever comes near him. Fail: Reflex stands still under fire, or Inert reacts. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch df-lone-soldier-reflex"
